[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 361.83, "timestamp": "00:06:01", "text": "あなたは一切間違いを犯していません。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 368.629, "timestamp": "00:06:08", "text": "それはすばらしい。それはすばらしい。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 370.23, "timestamp": "00:06:10", "text": "6回。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 370.87, "timestamp": "00:06:10", "text": "うん、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 373.51, "timestamp": "00:06:13", "text": "最初のジャンプの試み。ええ、4つです"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 376.23, "timestamp": "00:06:16", "text": "まだ先は長い。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 378.71, "timestamp": "00:06:18", "text": "音楽を使ってできます"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 379.43, "timestamp": "00:06:19", "text": "今。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 388.95, "timestamp": "00:06:28", "text": "音楽と一緒に、ですよね？わかった。それで、えーと、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 392.71, "timestamp": "00:06:32", "text": "インストゥルメンタルのみ、または、えーと、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 393.99, "timestamp": "00:06:33", "text": "私がインストゥルメンタルを担当します。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 395.189, "timestamp": "00:06:35", "text": "一緒に歌うことができますか"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 397.35, "timestamp": "00:06:37", "text": "インストゥルメンタル？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 399.83, "timestamp": "00:06:39", "text": "では、試してみます。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 401.35, "timestamp": "00:06:41", "text": "わかった。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 403.27, "timestamp": "00:06:43", "text": "こんにちは。えっと、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 404.55, "timestamp": "00:06:44", "text": "幸運を。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 411.51, "timestamp": "00:06:51", "text": "これです？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 415.43, "timestamp": "00:06:55", "text": "いや、たぶんこれかな、"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 418.924, "timestamp": "00:06:58", "author": "@AFroznThorn", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/UOd53-ssefezO2JWGQi-gSpM4zglLHS2XVfc2UQu3E-TdNk2KGnAZtWYAYqQBudbEouoIqf3=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "UCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/face-turquoise-music-note"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 419.27, "timestamp": "00:06:59", "text": "だって